":"Algebra","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Algebra"},{"title":"Bone-setting","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bone-setting"}]},{"text":"Mark Twain wrote the essay \"The Awful German Language\" to express his frustrations when learning German.","sources":[{"title":"Mark Twain","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Twain"},{"title":"The Awful German Language","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Awful_German_Language"},{"title":"German language","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_language"}]}],"fake":3,"original":"The word algebra is derived from an Arabic term for the surgical treatment of bonesetting.","change":{"kind":"what","old":"the surgical treatment of bonesetting","new":"the keeping of merchants' accounts","start":52,"end":89},"difficulty":1.0,"nli":0.9955,"fact_ids":["c5a8cbb12636","8fae16ef6cf2","29e011754a93","04adc0f94ac7","d3ddaa6aa0ca"]}]}